+  - Lines with qty >= 10 get extra 2.5% discount applied after line/tier discount
+  - Bulk discount calculated on amount remaining after line discount
+  - VAT calculated on amount after both line and bulk discounts
+  - invoiceTotals.discount field now includes both line discount and bulk discount
